# Sign up

Try it: **Tab**/**Shift+Tab** to move focus, type into the inputs,
**Space**/**Enter** to toggle the checkbox or click the button. Name below
starts with a suggested default — type or press Backspace to replace it.

::input{id="name" label="Name" value="Jane Doe"}
::input{id="email" label="Email" placeholder="you@example.com"}
::checkbox{id="agree" label="I agree to the terms"}
::button{id="submit" label="Submit"}
